# Phase-2 hunt run logs/artifacts (regenerable; TSVs added explicitly when wanted).
# `runs/*` rather than `runs/` so the negation below can re-include a subtree —
# git cannot re-include anything under an excluded *directory*.
runs/*
# The R=156 proof record: per-threshold node counts (main.ckpt) plus the
# per-unit trace that lets a verifier re-run a single subtree and check its
# node count, instead of redoing the whole search. ~11 MB of ASCII, ~3 MB
# packed. Not regenerable — this is the evidence.
!runs/ckpt156/

